            <span id="ctl00_cphRoblox_rbxUserPlacesPane_ctl17_rbxPlatform_lDescription">HD - High Detail, if anybody's going to ask.

YES, I KNOW ABOUT THE REGEN GLITCH, STILL TRYING TO FIX.

For people that have been wondering, i put HD in the title because i made the place more realistic, do you see the sun reflection in the water?
A large, mini town i made from scratch, the point of the game is to destroy the town for fun (And your enemies) And try to get a high score on the leaderboard.
The place is very destructable, and regenerates every 400 seconds (Doesn't look like much, but it is)
I'll be extending the city when it reaches 100,000 views! (If it even REACHES THAT MUCH, i'll eat my top hat, even though it's just a bunch of pixels)
Anyway, Enjoy!</span>
        </div>
    
